# My own RevMatchApp screenshots, staged here as input to
# scripts/make-downshift-mockup.py. Not licence-restricted like the PSD
# mockup they feed into, but they're intermediate inputs with no direct use
# outside that script, so they stay local like the Golden Gate buffers above.
archive/downshift-screens/

# Source model with an unknown licence (see ASSETS.md); only the rendered
# sprite under public/images/ is redistributed. Supply your own to reproduce
# scripts/prepare-golden-gate.swift.
archive/models/golden-gate-bridge.usdz

# Rendered from a MockupNest free-tier iPhone mockup (personal-use licence;
# redistributing the mockup file itself isn't permitted, so the composited
# output stays local-only — see ASSETS.md). Deployed to Cloudflare directly
# from this untracked file; supply your own PSD to reproduce with
# scripts/make-downshift-mockup.py.
public/images/downshift-mockup.avif
public/images/downshift-mockup.png
public/images/downshift-mockup-video-mask.png
public/images/downshift-mockup-static.avif
public/images/downshift-mockup-static.png

# Source model, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (Ddiaz Design / Sketchfab, see ASSETS.md and
# /credits/garage.html); the licence doesn't require withholding the source
# file itself, but there's no reason to carry a 4 MB zip in history when the
# merged/recoloured public/models/garage-gt350r.glb is what ships. Supply
# your own copy to reproduce scripts/prepare-garage-car.py.
archive/models/2016-ford-mustang-shelby-gt350r.usdz
